  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "Hugging Face began as a chatbot app for teenagers before becoming the hub for AI models."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Next: Cohere. Its CEO co-wrote 'Attention Is All You Need', the 2017 Transformer paper."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "Midjourney never took outside money. Meta licensed its tech instead (Aug 2025)."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "Fears over DeepSeek-R1 wiped about $589B off Nvidia's value in one day (Jan 27, 2025)."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Google owns DeepMind, SpaceX owns xAI and Cursor, and Nvidia is buying Hugging Face."
  }
